","body":"This is the source of the majority of the time lost. I am amazed that this stat did not completely cripple others' builds immediately - the only thing that made it tenable on my side was the use of a ramdisk output fs.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/blob/46f7106d0b20ae0ba245c3609545600ae379cea4/src/main/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/remote/TreeNodeRepository.java#L315-L318\r\n\r\nOf the total time change (4.55x observed)  the leaf path construction represented 7% of the overhead, with the stat resulting from the isDirectory check being 93%\r\n\r\nI've removed this section locally (since output directories are neither used nor do they work) and gotten my full cache hit performance back up to 0.9 levels.\r\n\r\n@ola-rozenfeld has indicated that we could cache the existence as a directory here to do the right thing without the cost. This (and many other instances I can think of) is begging for a \"IO ist verboten\" annotation that could be identified through static analysis.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/370105746/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"werkt","id":21398,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21398?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/werkt","html_url":"https://github.com/werkt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/werkt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/werkt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/werkt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/werkt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/werkt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/werkt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/werkt/repos","event